A||N||12||007DOUG||Fall cruise to Fiero Warehouse||||1||
Z||000000||007DOUG||10-13-2001||01:07 PM||||The Western PA Fiero Club has planned a fall cruise to "tour" Fiero Warehouse. <P>There will be a fiberglass demonstration by "Sage" and "Reality".......the manufactures of the full panel side scoops we sell.<P>And I'll demonstrate how to apply fastback GT windows.<P>There are several fieros and fiero parts in various stages of tear-down for you to view.<P>The event will happen Sunday Oct 21st at noon. Fiero Warehouse is located in Wheeling, WV<P>Everyone is welcome to stop by, visit with PFF and non-PFF members, talk fieros, and "tour" the warehouse. I'm really not that big of an operation. You could tour the place in 15 minutes. LOL<P>If you need directions, please e-mail me at dmkfiero@ovis.net Don't forget to include where you'll be driving from.<P>------------------<BR>4 Indy pace Cars<BR>84 T-top. IRM car<BR>86 GT Red<BR>86 GT Yellow ASAP<BR>86 GT Pearl White 3.4 T-top<BR>88 Coupe Red<BR>88 Formula Red 5 speed<BR>88 GT Black leather<BR>88 GT Black lumbar<BR>88 GT Black 3.4, 5 speed, T-top<P><BR>However......<BR><I>"Time is my most precious and most perishable of all my possessions."</I>||||reg||1
