Z||000006||kslish||10-14-2001||02:43 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Mark:<BR><B>Where did the Western PA Fiero Club webpage go? </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>We lost our web site host (NBCi.com).  NBCi.com did away with their webpage hosting service early this month.  It will be back up as soon as we manage to get the site moved to a new host.  <P><P>------------------<BR>Ken S.<BR>'87GT and '86SC<BR>See them at <A HREF="http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html" TARGET=_blank>http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html</A><BR>Western PA Fiero Club - <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A>||||reg||1
